      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Neck shield:\n\n● must conform to the General Requirements (see Section 3 above),\n\n● can be worn upon the Aventail. It must be firmly attached to the Aventail,\n\n● must have a shape inspired by the heater shield,\n\n● cannot exceed 15x17 cm,\n\n● can be painted,\n\n● if painted, must conform to the “Armors and Weapons Aesthetics and Decorations” document.",
