    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "7.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Gorget must:\n\n● conform to the General Requirements (see Section 3 above),\n\n● be constructed from plates,\n\n● cover the clavicles and back of the neck. The throat should have a low profile, be articulated or otherwise fitted in such a way that it doesn’t choke the wearer when their head is tilted forward.\n\n● be worn with appropriate armor styles and match historical sources in function and appearance.",
